<title>USA: Alabama National Q3 loan-loss allowances up.</title>
<headline>Alabama National Q3 loan-loss allowances up.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alabama National BanCorp said Wednesday that its allowance for loan losses were up in the third quarter.</p>
<p>Allowances for loan losses were $9.23 million compared with $5.5 million in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>For this year's third quarter, the company recovered $127,000 in bad debt, while in the same period a year ago, the company charged off $221,000.</p>
</text>
